{
  "$comment": "One client contract, three implementations. Every operation in docs/api-reference/openapi.json is listed once. A read records the real Server's answer (server, re-recorded with .github/scripts/run-backend-parity.sh server --record) and the Demo's: the same answer, the same answer with declared differences (omits, extra, because), its own answer where the Server cannot give one without a browser, a saved flow or picture, or absent with the reason. A write says whether the Demo answers it. The Backend stage of CI holds the Server, Desktop's Demo and Mobile's Demo to this file. Definition: docs/developer-guide/repo/ci.md.",
